  "translation": "Kuuma harĩ kĩu nĩkuuge therũ-inĩ, magana matano na magana matano, gĩathĩra kĩna ithuiyo inya hamwe, na thutha ũcio ama makũmi matano cia gĩcũji nĩcia kuuga gĩkũndĩ kĩayo kĩhĩtũkĩte, ihuhũrĩirie kĩu.",
